Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libgl1, libegl1
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-utils
Maintainer: Tharkis <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Tharkis/Ettin-Edit
Description: Modern, cross-platform text editor inspired by Notepad++
 Ettin Edit is a fast text and code editor with tabs, split view, syntax
 highlighting, multiple carets, compare, CsvQuery (SQL over CSV), JSON and
 XML tools, and plugins written in Python or JavaScript.
